:"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"とりあえず、wiki見てまた参加させてもらいます。ありがとうございます。","ts":"1622390253.334200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4MLg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22c814e1-edf8-47dc-85d6-5a9a06096067","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"なるほどー。結構奥が深いんですね。","ts":"1622390219.333600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ysf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"803a2516-724f-4bea-94d0-f9530aabfc54","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"セキュリティのカメラもアリバイ確保 + 監視でめちゃくちゃ強いんですけど、セキュリティ自体が殺されやすかったりするのが難しそう","ts":"1622390094.332800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGoZF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"523813aa-af28-43ab-ba06-774c7437dfa9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（なのでアドミンで注目して見られやすいんですけど）","ts":"1622390013.331200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bdf6bc4-e02e-480d-bd5f-534c6aa8a6e5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"メッドベイ・エレクトリカル奥・シールド・ナビゲーションあたりが分かりやすく危ないポイントですね","ts":"1622389973.330900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mgsxs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"570d43ad-e3b3-4ba3-a9cd-e38dca51cca1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"人が集まってるタイミングであれば危ないところいって殺されても容疑者絞りやすいので","ts":"1622389903.330100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k8Jwo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf1473b9-bac8-41d7-9380-b9c3de2f86c1","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"なるほどー。","ts":"1622389886.329700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ucJV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23c48763-3f77-4b23-ad00-3bf4a9a75d0c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なので自分はアドミン見てタスクかなり後回しにしてました","ts":"1622389869.329100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hhJ="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c62c609c-80ee-4368-aa71-c84eb8136332","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"なるほど。結構タスク処理するだけしか後半は意識出来てなかったです。","ts":"1622389801.328500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yof0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f4c702b-de73-4ab6-a591-20d3e344d2cb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"エレクトリカル奥は人が集まる停電後に行くとか、メッドベイのタスクは開幕のキルクールがギリ開けるかくらいの再開時に行くとか（これだと全員カフェから始まるから容疑者も比較的絞りやすくなるはず？）","ts":"1622389770.328300","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1622389781.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HhFy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04c60040-02ec-42db-8cb5-b12eb8c0f9e6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとは死なないだけでも村への貢献になるんで、危険なところは安全そうなタイミングで行くとかですね","ts":"1622389667.326200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEWm4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fcbc33e-a115-466c-a473-d305b5d7a71a","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"なるべく固ろうとは思ってたんですが、なんか 最初から疑心暗鬼になって二人行動を避けてたりしてましたw","ts":"1622389509.325300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4yPgo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f00e0625-4ec0-4e59-90e7-daea3c5bd601","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"できるだけ孤立しないようにするとか、サボタージュには人が集まってアリバイになるからできるだけ早く行くとか","ts":"1622389360.322800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l4LD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46030849-56c3-4e12-8baa-3562c2bbc7c5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（白を比較的取りやすい立ち回りするのが結構おすすめです）","ts":"1622389322.322100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uw2hk"}]